<!--
  Dogs mate (Continued) (Mlie.DogsMate, Workshop 2441132298, Mlie after Revolus).

  Since 1.6 added crossbreeding the mod uses the vanilla system. It still keeps a list of animal groups,
  Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef (1.6/Defs/CompatibleSpecies/*.xml), each with a <pawnKinds> list; at game
  start it makes every kind of a group mate with the others, and it shows "Can mate with" on the info card.

  DOGS MATE ALREADY KNOWS MOST OF OUR ANIMALS. Its own 1.6/Patches/sarg.magicalmenagerie.xml was written for
  Sarg's Magical Menagerie, whose defNames this port keeps, and it is guarded on the ThingDef: it applies to
  us as it stands. Read 2026-10-01 (pass 95c8 showed it: Kitsune listed Fox_Red with no patch of ours):

    MM_Catoblepas -> Pig     MM_Cerberus -> Dog     MM_CeryneianHind -> Deer
    MM_Kitsune -> Fox        MM_Pegasus, MM_Unicorn -> Horse

  Those choices are the mod's author's, not ours, and are left alone. This file used to add Cerberus,
  the hind and Pegasus a second time; it now adds only what that file leaves out and what our own text
  supports:

    MM_ErymanthianBoar    "a gargantuan, monstrous wild hog"  Pig   (WildBoar, Pig)

  NOT GROUPED, by either: Ahuizotl ("dog-like"), Qilin ("shaped like a deer", partially scaled), Wild
  Minotaur and Xiezhi (a bull; a lion and a goat: no group covers them), Kappa (human-like with a
  carapace), Griffin, Manticore, Chimera, the birds (Phoenix, Fenghuang, Ieltxu, Stymphalian Bird), the
  snakes (Basilisk, Salamander, Tlilcoatl), Lernaean Hydra, Lesser Wyvern, Will-o'-Wisp.

  The guard is a PatchOperationConditional on the group itself. Without Dogs mate the group does not exist,
  the xpath selects nothing, and the operation reports success and logs nothing. No load order: the groups
  are Defs, read after every patch, and the crosscheck runs at game start.

  The pairs of Better Crossbreeding are in BetterCrossbreedingPatch.xml.
-->
<Patch>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Pig"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
			<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Pig"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
			<value>
				<li>MM_ErymanthianBoar</li>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
